          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: उत्खनन",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उत्खनन — utkhanan — \"an excavation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उत्खननात जुनी भांडी सापडली. utkhananāt junī bhāṇḍī sāpaḍlī. Old pots were found in the excavation."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उत्खनन (utkhanan) करणे, to excavate."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उत्खनन (utkhanan) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit utkhanana, 'a digging up' (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
