              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अवशेष — avaśeṣ — \"remains; ruins\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "टेकडीवर एका जुन्या शहराचे अवशेष आहेत. ṭekḍīvar ekā junyā śahrāce avaśeṣ āhet. There are the remains of an old city on the hill."
