              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने खोदलं, tyāne khodlaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is dug agrees with the past: विहीर खोदली, रस्ता खोदला."
            }
